{
  "unit": {
    "id": "11",
    "title": "More verbs",
    "blurb": "dīcō, mittō, dūcō, doceō, rogō, inveniō and friends",
    "intro": "Time to widen your verb list. Some of these follow patterns you know (_iuvō, rogō, imperō_ are like _amō_; _doceō, respondeō, timeō_ are like _videō_), and some are third conjugation like _legō_: _dīcō, mittō, dūcō, quaerō, discō, vincō, dīvidō_. Remember the irregular commands _dīc!_ and _dūc!_, with no final -e."
  },
